WEBVTT

00:13.750 --> 00:15.080
Naoya...

00:16.880 --> 00:19.290
Hoshizaki-san, what do you think you're doing?!

00:19.940 --> 00:22.110
What's going on here?!

00:22.110 --> 00:26.630
Hoshizaki-san taped up Mukai-kun while he 
was unconscious and took him into the room.

00:28.090 --> 00:31.800
<b>Thump</b>

00:28.090 --> 00:31.800
<b>Thump</b>

00:28.090 --> 00:31.800
<b>Thump</b>

00:29.040 --> 00:31.800
Here I go, Naoya.

00:31.800 --> 00:34.010
She's totally about to do something naughty!

00:37.510 --> 00:40.790
You're so warm, Naoya...

00:43.020 --> 00:46.020
She definitely put it in!

00:55.030 --> 01:07.000
<i>Girlfriend, Girlfriend</i>

02:17.960 --> 02:19.470
Do you have a key?

02:19.470 --> 02:21.480
I think there should be a spare key somewhere.

02:21.480 --> 02:22.700
Let's find it!

02:22.700 --> 02:24.180
Right!

02:31.750 --> 02:33.640
Hey, you're awake.

02:35.030 --> 02:36.110
Yeah...

02:37.590 --> 02:39.050
Abducted again?!

02:39.520 --> 02:41.680
It's legal if a cute girl does it, right?

02:41.680 --> 02:43.510
Pretty sure that's not right!

02:43.510 --> 02:45.470
Why are you doing this again?

02:45.470 --> 02:46.460
What?

02:46.460 --> 02:48.850
I-Isn't it obvious?

02:50.320 --> 02:56.190
Because you're trying to kiss Saki.

02:56.190 --> 02:58.690
<b>Thump</b>

02:56.190 --> 02:58.690
<b>Thump</b>

02:59.720 --> 03:01.900
That's no reason to abduct me!

03:01.900 --> 03:03.530
It's more than enough reason!

03:03.530 --> 03:05.900
We're dating! Of course we're going to kiss!

03:05.900 --> 03:06.790
Nope!

03:07.080 --> 03:11.120
If you kiss, Saki's going to 
become precious to you,

03:11.120 --> 03:14.130
and then it'll be a pain in the butt 
trying to get you to break up!

03:14.130 --> 03:16.270
I don't want to be involved in a triple-timing!

03:16.270 --> 03:18.330
<i>That's</i> what you're concerned about?!

03:18.330 --> 03:20.090
Sh-Shut up!

03:20.090 --> 03:22.470
If you want a kiss that badly,

03:23.430 --> 03:26.760
you can kiss me and become 
infatuated with me instead!

03:34.270 --> 03:37.690
<b>Thump</b>

03:34.270 --> 03:37.690
<b>Thump</b>

03:34.270 --> 03:37.690
<b>Thump</b>

03:35.540 --> 03:36.380
Well?

03:36.380 --> 03:37.690
Just the cheek?!

03:37.690 --> 03:41.050
You said not on the mouth.

03:41.050 --> 03:43.520
Because that counts as sexy activity.

03:43.520 --> 03:45.240
That's the one thing you're honest about?

03:45.530 --> 03:47.200
I made you a promise.

03:47.200 --> 03:49.620
I should have said no abductions, too.

03:49.620 --> 03:53.610
I'm not going to become obsessed with 
you over something like this, though.

03:54.460 --> 03:58.410
B-But I get excited even 
if it's just on the cheek.

03:58.800 --> 04:00.060
Fine!

04:02.510 --> 04:05.220
M-My neck?!

04:06.040 --> 04:07.680
I can tell you're flustered!

04:17.800 --> 04:20.070
Th-There.

04:21.760 --> 04:23.030
You wouldn't!

04:27.340 --> 04:29.240
Oh, no!

04:29.620 --> 04:32.170
No more, or I'll...

04:40.880 --> 04:45.880
<b>Thump</b>

04:40.880 --> 04:45.880
<b>Thump</b>

04:42.880 --> 04:45.880
Th-This is embarrassing.

04:46.200 --> 04:47.610
Then don't do it!

04:47.610 --> 04:49.100
Sh-Shush!

04:49.530 --> 04:51.580
S-So, how was that?

04:51.580 --> 04:54.040
Are you a little more obsessed with me now?

04:54.040 --> 04:55.800
You said, "Oh, no."

04:55.800 --> 04:57.560
I-I meant...

04:58.960 --> 05:01.260
W-Wait...

05:01.260 --> 05:03.640
Seeing you more embarrassed than I am...

05:04.080 --> 05:05.650
brought me back to my senses.

05:08.120 --> 05:10.250
Fine, I'll do even more!

05:10.250 --> 05:12.380
I'm not letting you leave!

05:12.380 --> 05:13.700
You shouldn't do this!

05:13.700 --> 05:15.160
Shut up!

05:15.160 --> 05:17.120
I can't stand what I can't stand!

05:17.690 --> 05:22.340
I don't want you kissing anyone else!

05:22.950 --> 05:24.330
Mirika-san...

05:28.850 --> 05:30.280
Hoshizaki-san...

05:32.580 --> 05:34.160
Got it?

05:34.160 --> 05:36.310
No, er...

05:36.620 --> 05:38.270
I don't know how to respond to that.

05:38.270 --> 05:40.190
You piece of shit!

05:40.190 --> 05:42.190
I found a key!

05:42.190 --> 05:43.210
Sakisaki!

05:45.730 --> 05:49.070
Death to the horny pigtails!

05:52.660 --> 05:53.990
She got away!

05:59.720 --> 06:02.410
I'm never giving up!

06:02.840 --> 06:07.670
<i>Girlfriend, Girlfriend</i>

06:02.840 --> 06:07.670
<b>Thank God, he still
has them on!!</b>

06:04.630 --> 06:07.020
Thank God, he still has them on.

06:10.770 --> 06:12.600
Man, I'm pissed.

06:12.600 --> 06:16.060
Damn it, Mirika! You can never
let your guard down around her.

06:16.060 --> 06:17.190
Saki-san!

06:19.600 --> 06:22.190
Barbecue! Can't wait!

06:22.840 --> 06:24.320
Let's get that fire started!

06:24.320 --> 06:26.140
I'll get it right this time.

06:26.140 --> 06:28.940
Time to think up our next plan, Shino.

06:28.940 --> 06:32.180
We need to stop Naoya and Saki 
from kissing, no matter what.

06:32.960 --> 06:33.820
Yeah.

06:34.160 --> 06:36.340
What can we do?

06:38.840 --> 06:40.760
Would you have just stood there and watched

06:40.760 --> 06:42.840
as Naoya kissed Saki if 
I hadn't told you what to do?

06:43.440 --> 06:48.090
I don't want you kissing anyone else!

06:50.580 --> 06:54.930
I don't think I could be as shameless as you.

06:54.930 --> 06:56.520
Are you picking a fight with me?!

06:56.520 --> 06:59.360
No, I didn't mean that.

06:59.360 --> 07:01.880
So, do you have any ideas?

07:01.880 --> 07:03.500
Any way to stop them from kissing?

07:04.070 --> 07:06.230
You're the smartest person 
in our year, aren't you?

07:08.160 --> 07:11.280
Have them eat tons of garlic.

07:11.280 --> 07:12.840
You're a genius!

07:19.750 --> 07:20.920
Hey...

07:21.710 --> 07:25.960
Hypothetically, if you were 
friends with Sakisaki,

07:25.960 --> 07:27.820
would you get in their way like you are now?

07:29.670 --> 07:31.220
You totally would.

07:31.550 --> 07:33.400
You <i>are</i> picking a fight with me!

07:33.400 --> 07:35.180
I mean, I would, though!

07:35.600 --> 07:38.840
Who cares about anything except 
what's most important to you?

07:38.840 --> 07:40.680
In other words, anything other than Naoya.

07:40.680 --> 07:44.190
That's not how things work for most people.

07:44.190 --> 07:46.570
You're a real pain, aren't you?

07:47.120 --> 07:48.690
All right, done!

07:49.120 --> 07:50.320
Guys!

07:51.610 --> 07:53.710
I'm treating you to some good food.

07:53.710 --> 07:54.910
To make up for earlier.

07:54.910 --> 07:56.060
That looks good!

07:56.640 --> 07:58.880
This has a lot of garlic in it.

07:58.880 --> 08:00.660
It's going to smell!

08:01.180 --> 08:02.960
Mirika, you little...

08:02.960 --> 08:04.570
Just eat it!

08:04.570 --> 08:06.290
Open up, Naoya!

08:06.720 --> 08:08.250
You're gonna love it!

08:06.720 --> 08:08.250
Stop it!

08:13.660 --> 08:16.410
<i>If only I were like Hoshizaki-san</i>

08:16.410 --> 08:23.190
<i>and had the resolve and courage 
to go after nothing but my love.</i>

08:26.820 --> 08:28.170
Mukai-kun...

08:28.170 --> 08:29.130
Did you call?

08:30.710 --> 08:32.010
Mukai-kun?!

08:32.010 --> 08:33.360
Why are you here?

08:33.360 --> 08:35.990
You were acting a bit odd.

08:37.990 --> 08:40.780
You were calling me just now, weren't you?

08:40.780 --> 08:41.760
Did you need something?

08:41.760 --> 08:43.210
Why would you pry about that?!

08:43.210 --> 08:44.870
I definitely heard my name!

08:44.870 --> 08:46.380
It's your imagination!

08:46.380 --> 08:47.900
I-Is it?

08:47.900 --> 08:48.710
It is!

08:49.920 --> 08:52.540
Oh, that's the ribbon I gave you, isn't it?

08:52.540 --> 08:53.860
Back in middle school.

08:55.210 --> 08:57.470
You're still taking care of it, huh?

08:57.470 --> 08:58.720
I appreciate it.

08:58.720 --> 09:00.250
I-It's nothing.

09:00.250 --> 09:02.850
It just happens to have lasted a long time.

09:04.320 --> 09:08.430
You've still been taking care of 
Saki-chan since then, too.

09:08.430 --> 09:11.830
You even agreed to lend us your 
vacation home for Saki-chan's sake.

09:11.830 --> 09:13.930
You sure are kind.

09:13.930 --> 09:14.990
No, er...

09:14.990 --> 09:17.610
Wh-What brought this on?

09:17.610 --> 09:19.780
I've always thought so.

09:20.170 --> 09:22.480
Anyway, that's how I think of you.

09:22.480 --> 09:24.250
You matter to me.

09:24.570 --> 09:27.820
I'm always here to help when you need it.

09:28.170 --> 09:30.460
<b>Thump</b>

09:29.010 --> 09:30.460
Mukai-kun...

09:30.460 --> 09:34.190
You could have gone to a 
way better high school, too.

09:34.190 --> 09:37.610
But you chose the same school as Saki-chan.

09:39.350 --> 09:42.000
Let's go to the same school together!

09:40.550 --> 09:45.980
<i>I chose the same school as Sakisaki 
because I wanted to be close to Mukai-kun.</i>

09:42.000 --> 09:43.020
F-Fine...

09:46.280 --> 09:47.860
Two nights! Yay!

09:47.030 --> 09:48.760
<i>Same thing with the vacation home.</i>

09:47.860 --> 09:49.050
Awesome!

09:48.760 --> 09:54.360
<i>I thought that if we could stay longer, 
I'd have more chances with Mukai-kun.</i>

09:56.780 --> 09:57.900
<i>I'm pathetic.</i>

09:58.320 --> 09:59.900
<i>I hate myself.</i>

10:04.400 --> 10:08.150
I lied earlier.

10:08.150 --> 10:08.870
Huh?

10:09.700 --> 10:11.770
<i>I have to have some courage.</i>

10:12.180 --> 10:14.310
<i>Or I'm never getting anywhere.</i>

10:16.230 --> 10:18.880
This ribbon was actually...

10:22.140 --> 10:23.300
The ribbon!

10:26.060 --> 10:27.400
Shino-san!

10:28.280 --> 10:30.480
The waves are high! It's dangerous!

10:31.400 --> 10:32.440
No!

10:36.000 --> 10:38.660
It's too important to me!

10:39.530 --> 10:40.610
Look out!

10:48.310 --> 10:50.780
Shino-san!

11:06.720 --> 11:09.510
Thank goodness we made it to shore.

11:10.500 --> 11:11.980
Thanks.

11:13.760 --> 11:16.190
Let's go back to the others.

11:18.320 --> 11:19.140
Wait...

11:20.850 --> 11:21.830
Huh?

11:26.320 --> 11:28.640
A-An uninhabited island?!

11:29.830 --> 11:33.290
<b>Thump</b>

11:29.830 --> 11:33.290
<b>Thump</b>

11:30.090 --> 11:33.290
<i>I'm alone with Mukai-kun 
on an uninhabited island?!</i>

11:34.130 --> 11:36.760
<i>I-In a place like this?</i>

11:37.600 --> 11:42.320
<i>This might be a rare opportunity 
to get closer to Mukai-kun.</i>

11:42.320 --> 11:48.100
<i>In fact, if we can't make it back, we'll be 
living together for the rest of our lives.</i>

11:50.350 --> 11:51.830
Let's make a baseball team.

11:53.090 --> 11:55.150
<i>I don't know if I can bear that many children!</i>

11:55.150 --> 11:57.770
Hey, the main island's over there!

11:57.770 --> 11:59.820
It doesn't look that far.

11:59.820 --> 12:01.210
I should have figured!

12:01.210 --> 12:03.490
We just swam here.

12:03.990 --> 12:08.220
That said, it's too dangerous to 
get in the water in this darkness.

12:08.220 --> 12:10.710
Guess we'll have to spend the night here.

12:10.710 --> 12:12.420
Y-Yeah.

12:13.260 --> 12:14.780
Wait, what about the ribbon?!

12:18.760 --> 12:20.730
I managed not to lose it, thanks to you.

12:20.730 --> 12:22.090
What a relief.

12:23.630 --> 12:25.000
I'm sorry!

12:26.430 --> 12:28.940
This happened because 
I jumped into the water.

12:28.940 --> 12:31.980
Sakisaki and the others are worried for sure.

12:32.560 --> 12:34.600
I ruined our vacation.

12:36.660 --> 12:37.610
Wait...

12:39.360 --> 12:44.990
We ended up on an uninhabited island 
because I carried you in the wrong direction!

12:44.990 --> 12:46.510
I'm really sorry!

12:46.510 --> 12:47.200
Wait!

12:47.200 --> 12:49.680
It's not your fault, Mukai-kun!

12:49.680 --> 12:50.810
Thanks!

12:50.810 --> 12:53.640
In that case, let's call it even 
and forget about it.

12:54.980 --> 12:57.770
Besides, I'm happy you care so much

12:57.770 --> 13:00.630
about the ribbon that you 
jumped into the water for it.

13:01.560 --> 13:03.090
Well...

13:03.490 --> 13:07.540
Let's get back safely tomorrow 
and apologize to everyone.

13:07.540 --> 13:09.050
Y-Yeah.

13:09.050 --> 13:14.400
Besides, now that we're on an uninhabited 
island, we should make the most of it.

13:14.400 --> 13:16.310
It's not something you get to do every day.

13:17.120 --> 13:19.320
I dunno...

13:19.320 --> 13:22.800
By the way, why are you 
so attached to that ribbon?

13:22.800 --> 13:24.280
Let's enjoy our time here!

13:26.240 --> 13:29.390
The first thing to do on an uninhabited 
island is secure water.

13:30.080 --> 13:31.520
There are coconut trees here.

13:31.520 --> 13:33.040
I'll get them.

13:33.560 --> 13:35.130
A-Are you all right?

13:35.130 --> 13:36.300
I'm fine!

13:36.300 --> 13:37.540
This is nothing!

13:48.420 --> 13:50.840
S-S-S-S-S-Sorry!

13:50.840 --> 13:52.850
I'm sorry, too.

13:52.850 --> 13:55.800
Look, I found a coconut on the ground.

14:01.900 --> 14:04.230
I only saw it for a second!

14:08.480 --> 14:13.260
Wh-Why am I always like this 
in front of Mukai-kun?

14:13.260 --> 14:14.620
How many times has it been now?

14:14.620 --> 14:15.660
Shino-san...

14:15.660 --> 14:18.480
I'm usually a lot more proper, you know!

14:18.480 --> 14:19.670
I know!

14:19.670 --> 14:22.540
But I think you're adorable 
when you're like this, too.

14:22.540 --> 14:23.550
Ador—

14:24.310 --> 14:28.470
Wh-Why do you keep saying 
that sort of thing to everyone?

14:28.470 --> 14:30.220
I don't say this sort of thing to just anyone!

14:30.220 --> 14:31.020
Hey—

14:34.430 --> 14:36.470
<i>I-I'm so happy.</i>

14:41.150 --> 14:42.330
Viper!

14:46.500 --> 14:50.600
It's a bit dangerous, but it's kinda 
exciting and fun, isn't it?

14:54.150 --> 14:55.300
Yeah.

14:56.660 --> 15:01.420
<i>If only I could be with Mukai-kun all the time...</i>

15:02.630 --> 15:09.340
<i>Girlfriend, Girlfriend</i>

15:03.040 --> 15:07.660
We'll take one character each from Dad's 
name and call them Takuya and Naoko.

15:07.660 --> 15:08.660
Just kidding.

15:17.260 --> 15:18.300
Sorry.

15:18.720 --> 15:21.450
I-I don't mind...

15:22.730 --> 15:24.090
Are you cold?

15:24.090 --> 15:26.940
Right, your swimsuit's still damp.

15:27.360 --> 15:28.760
I'm fine.

15:29.820 --> 15:31.030
All right!

15:31.030 --> 15:32.520
Take it off!

15:32.520 --> 15:33.370
Huh?!

15:33.610 --> 15:36.700
You're going to get colder and 
colder wearing a wet swimsuit.

15:36.700 --> 15:37.700
B-But...

15:37.700 --> 15:40.360
Don't worry! I'll turn away!

15:40.360 --> 15:42.120
And I'll start a fire quick!

15:42.120 --> 15:44.190
In fact, I'll take mine off first!

15:44.190 --> 15:45.690
All right, I get it!

15:47.590 --> 15:51.010
Gather some twigs, make some friction...

15:51.390 --> 15:54.970
<i>I can't believe I'm getting 
naked near Mukai-kun.</i>

15:55.430 --> 15:58.220
<i>It's really embarrassing, but...</i>

15:59.810 --> 16:06.730
<i>I don't want my time with 
Mukai-kun to end uneventfully.</i>

16:09.740 --> 16:11.090
Mukai-kun...

16:11.090 --> 16:14.280
I t-took it all off.

16:14.280 --> 16:15.500
Okay.

16:15.500 --> 16:18.240
I'm starting a fire as quickly as I can. Hang on.

16:18.240 --> 16:20.830
Try not to be exposed to the wind.

16:22.260 --> 16:27.790
<i>Nothing will change if I just 
go on hiding my feelings for him.</i>

16:28.390 --> 16:31.480
You don't want to just watch 
with your finger in your mouth

16:31.480 --> 16:34.470
as they get closer to him, do you?

16:34.760 --> 16:38.300
I think you're so caught up 
in hiding your own feelings

16:38.300 --> 16:41.520
that you've lost sight of 
something more important.

16:42.870 --> 16:45.510
<i>I want to change something.</i>

16:53.890 --> 16:56.070
<i>I have to have confidence.</i>

16:56.720 --> 16:58.410
Sh-Shino-san?!

17:01.630 --> 17:03.650
I-I'm cold.

17:03.650 --> 17:06.960
You know... It'll be warmer if we stick together.

17:07.230 --> 17:08.890
I see. You're right.

17:08.890 --> 17:12.040
<i>I want him to notice me a bit.</i>

17:12.780 --> 17:15.290
Wait, do you need to lean on me naked, though?

17:15.290 --> 17:17.040
On a guy who isn't even your boyfriend?

17:17.040 --> 17:18.640
It's just <i>so</i> cold!

17:18.640 --> 17:22.270
You'd end up in deep trouble 
if it were another guy!

17:22.270 --> 17:22.850
Hey!

17:22.850 --> 17:24.080
Do you understand?!

17:24.080 --> 17:25.310
Please don't turn around!

17:26.690 --> 17:27.770
Sorry.

17:28.710 --> 17:31.860
You're safe, though, right?

17:32.200 --> 17:35.100
Of course, but it's a matter of 
being aware of the risks!

17:35.100 --> 17:37.110
I said don't turn around!

17:40.150 --> 17:42.910
<i>I'm feeling Mukai-kun's warmth.</i>

17:42.910 --> 17:44.700
<i>My heart's racing.</i>

17:46.040 --> 17:48.830
<i>Mukai-kun's been training lately.</i>

17:48.830 --> 17:50.980
<i>His back's a bit big.</i>

17:52.420 --> 17:55.980
<i>I wonder if Mukai-kun's heart is 
racing at least a little, too.</i>

17:57.140 --> 17:59.820
<i>Wh-What should I do next?</i>

18:01.670 --> 18:03.950
<i>I know! I'll get even closer!</i>

18:03.950 --> 18:04.970
Shino-san...

18:05.900 --> 18:08.350
Are you warm enough?

18:08.720 --> 18:10.300
Mukai-kun...

18:10.810 --> 18:12.650
Y-Yeah.

18:12.650 --> 18:14.730
I'm a little warmer.

18:14.730 --> 18:17.340
Okay. That's good to hear.

18:20.800 --> 18:22.740
<i>Get a grip, me!</i>

18:23.280 --> 18:30.250
<i>Mukai-kun isn't going to fall in love with me 
just because I bare myself even more.</i>

18:31.760 --> 18:35.210
<i>I need to have confidence in other ways.</i>

18:39.280 --> 18:42.050
There's someone I have a crush on.

18:46.660 --> 18:49.000
For a long time now.

18:50.870 --> 18:53.100
Shino-san...

18:54.070 --> 18:57.290
Then you <i>really</i> shouldn't be 
leaning against another guy naked!

18:57.290 --> 18:59.280
You're going to see everything!

18:59.700 --> 19:01.460
S-Sorry.

19:03.720 --> 19:05.820
I never knew, though.

19:06.840 --> 19:08.700
Does Saki-chan know?

19:11.680 --> 19:13.510
I could never tell anyone.

19:13.990 --> 19:15.450
It's been on my mind forever.

19:16.680 --> 19:20.380
But I wanted you to know.

19:20.930 --> 19:23.140
Sure, I'll hear you out.

19:24.160 --> 19:26.630
Have you told this person that you like them?

19:27.230 --> 19:33.240
I'd be causing a lot of trouble for him... 
and the person he cares about.

19:34.310 --> 19:36.390
I guess it's complicated, huh?

19:36.790 --> 19:37.550
Yeah.

19:38.180 --> 19:44.890
So I've been trying to give up, 
but I just can't.

19:46.690 --> 19:49.450
I shouldn't have fallen in 
love in the first place.

19:51.310 --> 19:53.500
But I keep falling in love even more.

19:56.060 --> 19:58.920
And I want him to love me back.

20:06.420 --> 20:11.500
But I'm scared to tell him how I feel.

20:13.240 --> 20:14.600
Shino-san...

20:15.490 --> 20:16.670
I'm sorry.

20:16.670 --> 20:18.780
What am I talking about?

20:19.330 --> 20:22.500
I'm such a pathetic coward.

20:24.740 --> 20:26.020
Shino-san!

20:27.780 --> 20:29.080
I got the fire started!

20:31.600 --> 20:33.130
It's warm.

20:34.740 --> 20:36.330
Thanks.

20:38.100 --> 20:39.590
I'm just guessing...

20:42.040 --> 20:47.800
But there's more that's dear to you than 
just dating that person you love, right?

20:50.050 --> 20:56.220
It's amazing how Mirika-san can pursue 
one thing without regard for anything else.

20:58.580 --> 21:04.220
But I also think you're amazing for being able 
to care about what's important to you,

21:04.220 --> 21:06.640
even if it hurts you.

21:08.370 --> 21:10.250
Mukai-kun...

21:12.230 --> 21:15.060
<i>This is where Mukai-kun was just now.</i>

21:15.750 --> 21:17.000
Show me your hand.

21:20.480 --> 21:24.300
I mean, yeah, when I was starting the fire...

21:25.810 --> 21:28.300
<i>He did that for me?</i>

21:30.000 --> 21:32.600
Mukai-kun, why?!

21:46.160 --> 21:48.440
I'm just doing what I want to do.

21:50.690 --> 21:51.830
<i>Stop it.</i>

21:52.770 --> 21:54.940
<i>If you keep being so nice to me...</i>

21:58.280 --> 22:01.690
<i>I won't be able to hold back!</i>

22:21.980 --> 22:26.990
<b>Her Resolve</b>

23:57.480 --> 23:59.640
Next episode preview, but it's on Risapon TV!

23:59.640 --> 24:01.260
Shino-san goes for the 
surprise kiss on the island!

24:01.260 --> 24:03.180
Next time, Shino-san takes it even further!

24:03.180 --> 24:05.070
D-Do you mean...

24:05.070 --> 24:06.060
You did good!

24:06.060 --> 24:07.590
I did <i>that</i> good?!

24:07.590 --> 24:09.000
I'm not talking about anything sexy.

24:09.000 --> 24:11.220
Huh? I-I knew that!
